OL,3,GNEWSACycle routes not finished a decade
OL,4,Aafter agreement
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners have questioned why almost
OL,7,Fa dozen cycle and walking routes remain
OL,8,Funfinished - or have not even been
OL,9,Fstarted - 10 years after the scheme was
OL,10,Fagreed.
OL,12,FThe "greenway" project, managed by the
OL,13,FGreater Cambridge Partnership (GCP),
OL,14,Faims to improve walking and cycling
OL,15,Fjourneys between the city and various
OL,16,Ftowns and villages.
OL,18,FHowever, since 2016, only one route has
OL,19,Fbeen fully completed - from Horningsea
OL,20,F- although work has been done on
OL,21,Fsections of several others.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
